typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">Glasstec 2024 in D\u00fcsseldorf has proven to be an invaluable experience for Vulcan Shield Global, providing us with the opportunity to connect with industry leaders across diverse sectors, including glass production, furnace manufacturing, mirror production, ceramics, battery technology, and thermocouple manufacturing. These discussions highlight not only the current challenges these industries face in high-temperature applications but also the transformative potential of high-performance insulation materials, such as our Alumina Fiber products.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82bcdc9 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"82bcdc9\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t<style>\/*! elementor - v3.19.0 - 28-02-2024 *\/\n.elementor-widget-image{text-align:center}.elementor-widget-image a{display:inline-block}.elementor-widget-image a img[src$=\".svg\"]{width:48px}.elementor-widget-image img{vertical-align:middle;display:inline-block}<\/style>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"427\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Glasstec-Cover-1024x683.png\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1188\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Glasstec-Cover-1024x683.png 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Glasstec-Cover-300x200.png 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Glasstec-Cover-768x512.png 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Glasstec-Cover-1536x1025.png 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Glasstec-Cover.png 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-bf1cf13 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"bf1cf13\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-8793351 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"8793351\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><span style=\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Expanding the Rold of Alumina Fiber in High-Temperature Applications<\/span><\/h2>\n<p>As manufacturing processes evolve, so too do the demands for materials that can withstand ever-higher temperatures without compromising efficiency or safety. Alumina Fiber has emerged as a standout solution for applications where conventional materials, like silica insulation, fall short. While silica can offer effective insulation at moderate temperatures, it degrades under extreme heat, requiring frequent maintenance and replacements. Alumina Fiber, on the other hand, remains stable and reliable in the most intense thermal environments, significantly reducing maintenance costs and enhancing the longevity of critical components.<\/p>\n<p>This durability makes our Alumina Fiber products ideal for insulating components that operate under high thermal stress.<\/p>\n<h1><span style=\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">Leading Applications of Alumina Fiber in High-Temperature Environments<\/span><\/h1>\n<p><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">Meeting with industry leaders and experts, we\u2019ve had many meaningful discussions and uncovered their pain points, identifying key areas where our Alumina Fiber products can make a transformative impact. Below are some of the applications of Alumina Fibers that industry leaders are excited about.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align); letter-spacing: 0.4px;\"><b style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px;\">Waste Incinerator Erosion Prevention<\/b><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Our Alumina Fiber <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-fabric\/\" style=\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">woven fabric<\/a><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\"> provides effective insulation in waste incinerators, where it protects refractory ceramic fiber (RCF) modules from erosion. This application extends the lifespan of incinerator components and maintains operational efficiency under harsh conditions.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Insulation for Glass Rollers in Furnaces<br><\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">The intense heat of glass furnaces requires durable, heat-resistant insulation. Vulcan Shield Global\u2019s Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/braided-sleeve\/\">braided sleeves<\/a> effectively insulate rollers in these furnaces, protecting the rollers from the heat of the glass, extending the rollers\u2019 service life.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><b style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px;\">High-Temperature Fabric for Glass Bending <\/b><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Glass bending applications demand a heat-resistant material on the moulds that won\u2019t degrade or mark glass surfaces. Our F-72 woven Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-fabric\/\">woven fabric<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/braided-sleeve\/\">braided sleeves<\/a> provide the ideal solution, maintaining high-temperature resistance without leaving any markings on the finished glass products.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><b style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px;\">Battery Powder Saggars for Lithium-Ion Production<\/b><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Alumina <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product_category\/long-fibers\/\">long fibers<\/a> are instrumental in the production of saggars for lithium-ion battery powder, enabling saggars to withstand high temperatures without warping or wearing down. This application is critical in battery production, where consistent heat resistance is essential for quality control.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Hybrid Vehicle Insulation<br><\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">As hybrid vehicles rise in popularity, the need for reliable, lightweight, high-temperature insulation has become essential. Vulcan Shield Global\u2019s Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-needled-blanket\/\">needled blankets<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/braided-sleeve\/\">braided sleeves<\/a> are used to insulate key components in hybrid vehicles, improving efficiency and safety without adding unnecessary weight.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><strong style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px; letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Insulation in Laser and Plasma Cutting Equipment<br><\/strong><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Our Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/braided-sleeve\/\">braided sleeves<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-fabric\/\">woven fabric<\/a> insulate pipes and other components in laser and plasma cutting equipment, protecting them from the high heat generated during cutting. This prevents overheating, extends equipment lifespan, and ensures optimal performance.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><b style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px;\">Thermocouple Sleeving and Insulation<\/b><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Thermocouples, used extensively in high-temperature monitoring, require insulation that won\u2019t degrade in extreme heat. Our Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/braided-sleeve\/\">braided sleeves<\/a> provide essential insulation, ensuring accurate temperature readings and extending thermocouple lifespan.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><b style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px;\">Furnace Repairs<\/b><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Furnace components often need resilient insulation to withstand intense heat. Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-needled-blanket\/\">needled blankets<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-woven-fabric\/\">woven fabric<\/a> are ideal solutions, offering the durability and temperature resistance required for long-lasting repairs.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0.4px; font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; text-align: var(--text-align);\"><b style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 26px;\">Thin Blankets for Catalyst Insulation<\/b><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"font-size: 26px;\"><b><br><\/b><\/span><\/span><\/span><span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text ); font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight ); letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Our thin Alumina Fiber <a href=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/product\/alumina-fiber-needled-blanket\/\">needled blankets<\/a> (3mm) provide lightweight yet effective insulation for catalysts used in processes reaching 900\u00b0C. This application is ideal for protecting catalysts without sacrificing thermal efficiency.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e49c475 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e49c475\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;content_width&quot;:&quot;boxed&quot;}\" data-core-v316-plus=\"true\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-96f2b84 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"96f2b84\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h2><span style=\"font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.4px; text-align: var(--text-align);\">Meeting with Industry Leaders to Drive Future Collaboration<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: 0.4px;\">At Glasstec, we were thrilled to have meaningful conversations with leaders across industries who are driving advancements in glass production, ceramic manufacturing, battery technology, and more. These conversations underscored the rising demand for advanced, high-temperature materials that deliver both resilience and efficiency. Our Alumina Fiber products, engineered for optimal performance in extreme heat, align perfectly with these needs. By providing consistent, reliable protection against thermal degradation, our products support higher productivity and safety across multiple sectors.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-82653d6 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"82653d6\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" src=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Side-Shot-of-Booth-1024x768.jpeg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1192\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Side-Shot-of-Booth-1024x768.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Side-Shot-of-Booth-300x225.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Side-Shot-of-Booth-768x576.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Side-Shot-of-Booth-1536x1152.jpeg 1536w, https:\/\/www.vulcanshield.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/10\/Side-Shot-of-Booth.jpeg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 